# Local Claude Code state stays private, EXCEPT the sub-agent definitions, which are
# tooling the whole programme depends on and must travel with the repo. (Note the
# `.claude/*` form: a negation cannot re-include anything under a directory that is
# itself excluded, so `.claude/` + `!.claude/agents/` would silently not work.)
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**

